    "title": "Vote for top Bucks County area football coach heading into 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tom Moore ,\n19 hours ago We want to know who you think is the top high school football head coach in the Bucks County area heading into 2026.\nCouncil Rock South's Gavin Sailer was the leading vote-getter in the top 2026 football player poll at 30.2 percent, with Lansdale Catholic's Terrance Smith second (22%).\nOur polls are designed to recognize excellent local high school athletes and we ask that you vote for your favorites as many times as you wish. But we also ask that you play fair. In other words, keep the bots or crazy cheats out of our polls. We shouldn't see a bunch of players with a significant number of votes from various European countries.\nAny suspicion of bot activity will result in immediate removal of the athlete, and possibly teammates, from this and future polls.",
    "summary": "Council Rock South's Gavin Sailer was the leading vote-getter in the top 2026 football player poll at 30.2 percent, with Lansdale Catholic's Terrance Smith second (22%). Our polls are designed to recognize excellent local high school athletes and we ask that you vote for your favorites as many times as you wish. In other words, keep the bots or crazy cheats out of our polls. We shouldn't see a bunch of players with a significant number of votes from various European countries.",
